A **Dragon** is a terrifying opponent. As if its enormous size and
strength weren't enough, there's the small matter of its fiery breath,
which can surprise an unready adventurer (or an unlucky villager).
*Armored +2, Attack +2 (Fire Breath: Area Effect, Ranged; 10
Endurance—Claw & Bite: Reach; Inaccurate), Combat Expert +1, Flight
+2, Intimidating +2, Smart +1, Strong +2, Tough +2; Awkward Size −3,
Obsession −2 (Treasure), Slow −1, Stubborn −2.*

